  "privacyTitle": "Your photos stay yours.",
  "privacyBody": "The library, its records and its faces live in a database on this iPhone and are worked out here — grouping, search and face recognition all run on the device. There is no Photos Vault server and no account, so nothing ever reaches whoever made this app. Photos leave only where you send them: your own bucket for backup, your own iCloud, your own key for an AI analysis. Keys stay in the Keychain, never in a backup. Delete the app and the local data goes with it.",
